# MaixAiRover quality rules

- SOLID; 1 class per file; file under 400 lines; class under 30 methods.
- Docstrings on every public class and public method.
- Forbidden: `getattr`, `setattr`, tuple payloads, anonymous dicts as DTOs.
- Prefer dataclasses with named fields for all cross-boundary data.
- Hardware behind `I2cBus` port; default config may use stub.
- Prefer structural simplification (thermo-nuclear) over local cleanup-only edits.
